{"id": 21210, "title": "How to Get to People’s Park?", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK3"], "slug": "how-to-get-to-peoples-park", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/21210_how-to-get-to-peoples-park.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["A ： 请问人民公园怎么走？", "B ： 你先去等92 路公共汽车， 坐四站下车， 然后换地铁二号线， 往机场方向坐三站， 换乘六号线， 再坐两站就到人民公园站了。 出了地铁站你就能看到人民公园的大门。", "A ： 太麻烦了， 我还是打车吧。 谢谢！"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["A ： 請問人民公園怎麼走？", "B ： 你先去等92 路公共汽車， 坐四站下車， 然後換地鐵二號線， 往機場方向坐三站， 換乘六號線， 再坐兩站就到人民公園站了。 出了地鐵站你就能看到人民公園的大門。", "A ： 太麻煩了， 我還是打車吧。 謝謝！"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["A：  qǐng wèn rén mín gōng yuán zěn me zǒu？", "B：  nǐ xiān qù děng 92  lù gōng gòng qì chē，  zuò sì zhàn xià chē，  rán hòu huàn dì tiě èr hào xiàn，  wǎng jī chǎng fāng xiàng zuò sān zhàn，  huàn chéng liù hào xiàn，  zài zuò liǎng zhàn jiù dào rén mín gōng yuán zhàn le。  chū le dì tiě zhàn nǐ jiù néng kàn dào rén mín gōng yuán de dà mén。", "A：  tài má fan le，  wǒ hái shi dǎ chē ba。  xiè xie！"], "english_paragraphs": ["A: How to get to People’s Park?", "B: You need to wait for bus No. 92 first, get off in four stops, then change to subway line 2, take three stops toward the airport, transfer to line 6, and take another two stops to People's Park Station. After exiting the subway station, you can see the gate of People's Park.", "A: It’s too much trouble. I’d better take a taxi. Thanks!"], "english_full": "A: How to get to People’s Park?\n\nB: You need to wait for bus No. 92 first, get off in four stops, then change to subway line 2, take three stops toward the airport, transfer to line 6, and take another two stops to People's Park Station. After exiting the subway station, you can see the gate of People's Park.\n\nA: It’s too much trouble. I’d better take a taxi. Thanks!", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">A</span><span class=\"tr\">A</span><rt></rt></ruby> ： <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"qǐng wèn\" data-defn=\"Excuse me, may I ask...?\" data-hsk=\"H